    "successor_tariff_id": "srp:E-23",
    "eligibility_notes": "Frozen from new participation as of the November 2025 billing cycle; may be eliminated earlier if administrative capability allows. Limited to residential customers without on-site generation, plus grandfathered on-site generation customers who by December 8, 2014 either (a) originally installed the on-site generation at the residence, (b) delivered SRP a fully executed installation contract, or (c) had an SRP Residential Solar Electric Program Application pending — and in each case interconnected with SRP's grid by February 26, 2016. Grandfathered service applies at the residence where the system was originally installed and continues until the later of November 1, 2025 or 20 years after initial interconnection. The exception runs with the property, applying to the initial customer of record and any subsequent customer of record at that residence. Notwithstanding the freeze, a customer who cancels may return to this plan within 90 days; otherwise they may not re-elect for at least one year after cancellation."
  },

